      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This feeling of an unbridgeable \"gap\" and the exhaustion of constant self-deception often points to deep existential depression rather than a temporary phase. The pressure to maintain a \"play\" when you feel you see the \"reality\" can be so heavy that you feel trapped inside the performance. Please know that you do not have to stay in the dark to help others in the light, and a compassionate hurt can sometimes be the only safe way to help.",
